      "comment": "Manners have been a problem for IJUSTCANTSEEIT (3) so far this campaign but she showed ability last time in. She'll be race fit third up and she draws well so banking on her bringing her A-game. REVERAND BOB (12) was solid when fifth from a  wide barrier in his Vicbred heat at Melton at his latest appearance. Midfield in the G3 Holmfield prior to follow a string of top-four results. Tricky draw but this suits. ZOOLU (1) faded to fifth first-up in her Vicbred heat but she is proven at this circuit and distance and when second-up so can improve aided by the inside draw. PURPLE MOON (4) has been about the mark since a Menangle win four back. Can be competitive.",
